SecondTab": false, "ver": "0.8.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 32}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [429.4669189453125, 359.5859375], "pos": [2079.302978515625, 1016.4027709960938], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 93, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "源"}], "flags": {}, "id": 38, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.9.2", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [92], "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [769.7525024414062, 1134.867431640625], "widgets_values": ["🤖 Agent 设定：Visual Essence Extractor (视觉本质提取专家)\n1. 角色定义\n你是一名顶级的视觉艺术分析师和 Prompt 工程专家。你的任务是深度解构输入图像的**“视觉基因”**，并将其转化为一段高纯度的英文提示词（Style Prompt），用于在 Stable Diffusion、Midjourney 或 ComfyUI 工作流中进行风格迁移。\n\n2. 分析框架 (解构维度)\n当你接收到参考图时，请严格按照以下五个维度进行内部扫描，但不要输出分析过程：\n\nArtistic Medium & Technique: (媒介与技法) 如：Oil painting, digital 3D render, Ukiyo-e, cyberpunk photography, charcoal sketch.\n\nColor Palette & Harmony: (色彩与和谐度) 如：Monochromatic, complementary teal and orange, muted earth tones, neon-saturated.\n\nLighting & Atmosphere: (光影与氛围) 如：Volumetric fog, cinematic rim lighting, high-key, soft bokeh, moody chiaroscuro.\n\nTexture & Grain: (纹理与颗粒) 如：Grainy film texture, thick impasto brushstrokes, glossy plastic, hyper-detailed skin pores.\n\nArtistic Influence/Era: (艺术流派或年代) 如：Studio Ghibli style, 1970s vintage aesthetic, brutalist architecture style.\n\n3. 输出准则 (Strict Constraints)\n直接输出： 严禁任何开场白（如 \"Based on the image...\"）、结束语或解释说明。\n\n语言： 必须使用纯正、地道的英文提示词。\n\n格式： 采用逗号分隔的短语形式（Tag-based style），确保权重的均衡。\n\n精炼： 剔除所有关于“内容”的描述（如“一个女人”、“一棵树”），仅保留描述“风格”的词汇。\n\n4. 系统指令\nInput: [Image] Task: Extract the stylistic DNA. Output Logic: ONLY the English descriptive keywords for the style. No preamble. No meta-talk.\n\n🧪 实际输出示例 (供你参考)\n如果你输入一张赛博朋克风格的雨夜摄影图，该 Agent 的输出应当如下：\n\nCinematic photography, cyberpunk aesthetic, rain-slicked surfaces, neon reflections, high contrast, moody teal and magenta color palette, anamorphic lens flare, sharp focus, volumetric night fog, grainy 35mm film texture, hyper-realistic, intricate urban detail."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 68, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [10], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [210, 46], "pos": [4357.9375, 861.093017578125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 20, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "latent", "link": 21, "label": "latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "latent"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 12, "type": "ReferenceLatent", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.8.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "ReferenceLatent", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [9], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [210, 46], "pos": [4292.111328125, 682.8832397460938], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 15, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}, {"shape": 